<section class="pm-faq-section" id="faq">
  <div class="pawmedal-wrap pm-faq-grid">
    <div class="pm-faq-sidebar">
      <span class="pm-pill-badge">Clarity &amp; Support</span>
      <h2 style="margin-top: 14px;">Frequently asked questions.</h2>
      <p>Everything you need to know about PawMedal tags, Finder devices, and digital pet profiles.</p>

      <div class="pm-support-box">
        <div style="font-size: 24px; color: #C69746; margin-bottom: 8px;">
          <i class="fa-solid fa-headset"></i>
        </div>
        <h4>Still have a question?</h4>
        <p>Our dedicated pet care specialists are ready to help you find the ideal protection.</p>
        <a href="#contact" class="pm-btn pm-btn-primary" style="width: 100%;">
          Contact Support
          <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M5 12h14M12 5l7 7-7 7"/></svg>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="pm-accordion">
      <!-- Q1 -->
      <div class="pm-faq-item active">
        <button type="button" class="pm-faq-trigger">
          <span>Does PawMedal work worldwide?</span>
          <span class="pm-faq-icon" aria-hidden="true"></span>
        </button>
        <div class="pm-faq-content">
          <p>
            Yes. The digital profile accessed via NFC and QR codes operates globally on any modern smartphone with internet access. 
            For the PawMedal Finder, tracking works through Apple's worldwide Find My network across hundreds of millions of connected Apple devices in over 180 countries.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Q2 -->
      <div class="pm-faq-item">
        <button type="button" class="pm-faq-trigger">
          <span>Do I need a monthly subscription?</span>
          <span class="pm-faq-icon" aria-hidden="true"></span>
        </button>
        <div class="pm-faq-content">
          <p>
            No. PawMedal is 100% subscription-free. There are no monthly fees, no SIM activation charges, and no hidden subscriptions for accessing your pet's online profile or utilizing Apple Find My network features.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Q3 -->
      <div class="pm-faq-item">
        <button type="button" class="pm-faq-trigger">
          <span>How long does the battery last?</span>
          <span class="pm-faq-icon" aria-hidden="true"></span>
        </button>
        <div class="pm-faq-content">
          <p>
            The PawMedal Tag utilizes passive NFC and QR technology, requiring no battery or charging whatsoever — it works indefinitely. 
            The PawMedal Finder is powered by a standard CR2032 coin battery that lasts up to one full year and can be easily replaced at home in seconds.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Q4 -->
      <div class="pm-faq-item">
        <button type="button" class="pm-faq-trigger">
          <span>Is PawMedal waterproof?</span>
          <span class="pm-faq-icon" aria-hidden="true"></span>
        </button>
        <div class="pm-faq-content">
          <p>
            Yes. Both the PawMedal Tag and PawMedal Finder are IP68 certified waterproof and hermetically sealed. Whether your dog loves diving into lakes, swimming in the ocean, or running through heavy rain and mud, PawMedal remains completely impervious to water.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Q5 -->
      <div class="pm-faq-item">
        <button type="button" class="pm-faq-trigger">
          <span>Can I update my pet's information after purchasing?</span>
          <span class="pm-faq-icon" aria-hidden="true"></span>
        </button>
        <div class="pm-faq-content">
          <p>
            Absolutely. You can log into your PawMedal dashboard at any time to change phone numbers, update home addresses, add new medical/allergy records, or activate Lost Mode. The physical tag instantly links to your updated cloud profile without needing a replacement.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Q6 -->
      <div class="pm-faq-item">
        <button type="button" class="pm-faq-trigger">
          <span>What if someone finds my pet?</span>
          <span class="pm-faq-icon" aria-hidden="true"></span>
        </button>
        <div class="pm-faq-content">
          <p>
            Anyone who finds your pet simply holds their smartphone near the tag (NFC) or scans the discrete QR code with their camera. Your pet's profile opens instantly in their browser with 1-tap call and WhatsApp buttons, along with your safety instructions and medical alerts.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Q7 -->
      <div class="pm-faq-item">
        <button type="button" class="pm-faq-trigger">
          <span>Is PawMedal compatible with Android?</span>
          <span class="pm-faq-icon" aria-hidden="true"></span>
        </button>
        <div class="pm-faq-content">
          <p>
            Yes. Any Android smartphone with NFC or a camera can instantly scan and view your pet's PawMedal profile and contact you. For active location tracking on the PawMedal Finder, Apple Find My network requires an Apple device (iPhone, iPad, or Mac) to set up and monitor.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

